-- E-FISMA: MySQL 8.4 VIEW definitions migrated from MariaDB 11.8.9.
-- Requires base tables and data to have been imported into the CURRENT selected database.
-- Original production DEFINER omitted: new views use the importing MySQL account.
-- Temporary dummy views and MariaDB-specific client commands removed.
